"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T18:44:54Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T18:44:54Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4013417940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4015917283","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116685#issuecomment-4015917283","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/116685","id":4015917283,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7vXgjj","user":{"login":"Nodragem","id":10520249,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNTIwMjQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10520249?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem","html_url":"https://github.com/Nodragem","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Nodragem/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-07T08:08:41Z","updated_at":"2026-03-07T08:08:41Z","body":"> In the past we had endless problems with GridMap hotkeys conflicting with something else \r\n\r\nNow we have the Transform mode. The idea is that when not in Transform mode, the shortcuts are consumed by Gridmap, when in Transform mode, the shortcuts are passed to the editor. (It was named this way because it solved the conflicts with transform shortcuts, but we can extend the idea to all shortcuts)\r\n\r\nThis way there should be no conflict anymore. The only problem with `F` is that we may want to reserve it for Focus when we will implement a real focus that focuses on the currently selected cells.\r\n\r\nI'm not too fond of the ALT+G and of the current icon used, but at least, we can easily reset the rotation now 😀 ! I wonder if we could make new icons for all these rotations operations... 🤔\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4015917283/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]